WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.300
Safex

00:00:05.672 --> 00:00:07.766
Somebody has used the name 'Terry'

00:00:07.916 --> 00:00:10.001
and checked in the hospital
where Candy was working.

00:00:10.151 --> 00:00:12.874
It turned out to be bad boy Charlie.

00:00:14.314 --> 00:00:19.611
Moreover,
Charlie has escaped from prison.

00:00:19.761 --> 00:00:22.154
The police are looking for him
everywhere.

00:00:27.160 --> 00:00:33.099
Flowers from the heart

00:00:36.337 --> 00:00:38.798
Candy, you lied to me!

00:00:39.073 --> 00:00:40.734
Quiet!

00:00:44.712 --> 00:00:46.539
Charlie, I didn't do it!

00:00:46.689 --> 00:00:49.005
It wasn't me who called the police!

00:00:49.225 --> 00:00:51.177
You don't have to explain anything.

00:00:51.327 --> 00:00:53.078
I was so stupid to trust you!

00:00:53.228 --> 00:00:54.518
Charlie!

00:00:59.893 --> 00:01:01.887
What has Candy done again?

00:01:02.037 --> 00:01:04.130
She was covering for Charlie.

00:01:05.299 --> 00:01:09.395
Candy already knew his true identity?

00:01:09.637 --> 00:01:13.346
She just can't keep herself away
from trouble, can she!

00:01:21.181 --> 00:01:22.184
Doctor Bobson.

00:01:22.324 --> 00:01:24.913
Where are you taking the patient?

00:01:25.953 --> 00:01:27.680
To the hospital
in the juvenile prison.

00:01:27.830 --> 00:01:32.685
You will need my permission
if you want to move the patient.

00:01:32.935 --> 00:01:35.254
But this young man is a criminal...

00:01:35.404 --> 00:01:37.223
If we stop his current treatment,

00:01:37.373 --> 00:01:41.731
he will remain with a scar on his face.

00:01:42.011 --> 00:01:44.036
The principal has given his permission.

00:01:44.371 --> 00:01:46.131
This has nothing to do with it!

00:01:46.281 --> 00:01:49.107
This is about the patient!

00:01:50.544 --> 00:01:51.604
Unless...

00:01:51.754 --> 00:01:56.541
You are taking him
to a better doctor than me.

00:01:56.691 --> 00:01:57.977
But Doctor...

00:01:58.127 --> 00:02:01.814
Isn't he going to be a bad influence...

00:02:01.964 --> 00:02:04.157
If we leave him
with normal patients?

00:02:04.392 --> 00:02:09.154
Doctor Bobson,
I will take care of Charlie.

00:02:09.304 --> 00:02:12.123
Right, I will convince the principal.

00:02:12.700 --> 00:02:13.928
Yes!

00:02:19.340 --> 00:02:21.867
Thank goodness, Charlie!

00:02:22.117 --> 00:02:23.471
Sorry to get you involved in this.

00:02:24.111 --> 00:02:26.305
It's ok, you can blame me.

00:02:26.455 --> 00:02:28.678
But you need to thank Doctor Bobson.

00:02:29.350 --> 00:02:30.874
Stop acting cool.

00:02:31.118 --> 00:02:34.087
Having a scar on my face
it makes me look like a gangster.

00:02:35.823 --> 00:02:37.882
Charlie, you...

00:02:38.659 --> 00:02:40.853
Although I am a bad guy...

00:02:41.003 --> 00:02:43.155
I never hated anyone in my life.

00:02:43.405 --> 00:02:44.123
Me too.

00:02:44.273 --> 00:02:46.993
I never framed anyone.

00:02:47.373 --> 00:02:48.893
So who called the police?

00:02:49.043 --> 00:02:52.227
The police was after me,
only you knew about it.

00:02:52.377 --> 00:02:54.598
Oh yeah, if I think about it...

00:02:57.210 --> 00:02:58.673
Eliza!

00:02:58.996 --> 00:03:01.510
She didn't keep her word!

00:03:10.557 --> 00:03:13.151
Eliza, are you looking for me?

00:03:13.401 --> 00:03:16.902
I thought you were fired,
why are you still here?

00:03:17.731 --> 00:03:19.426
Why should I get fired?

00:03:20.166 --> 00:03:23.067
You were sheltering a criminal,
there are evidences.

00:03:23.303 --> 00:03:27.030
Eliza, you called the police,
didn't you?

00:03:27.807 --> 00:03:30.869
It was my duty as a good citizen.

00:03:31.119 --> 00:03:34.880
But we had a deal!

00:03:39.986 --> 00:03:42.487
Sometimes I lie.

00:03:45.292 --> 00:03:48.887
You know, you are sick!

00:03:50.096 --> 00:03:51.791
You seem to know me very well.

00:03:52.332 --> 00:03:54.664
Excuse me, I have work to do.

00:03:54.834 --> 00:03:55.926
Candy!

00:03:56.503 --> 00:03:59.529
Why do you think
I came to hospital today?

00:04:04.511 --> 00:04:06.804
The invoice from the hospital?

00:04:06.994 --> 00:04:10.982
Yeah, the fee that
young gangster owes.

00:04:12.252 --> 00:04:14.546
You want me to pay for that?

00:04:14.796 --> 00:04:18.551
Yeah. I thought he was Terry.

00:04:18.792 --> 00:04:20.318
Although the Adleys are rich,

00:04:20.568 --> 00:04:23.457
they aren't so stupid
to pay for that young gangster.

00:04:23.630 --> 00:04:25.634
But the bill...

00:04:25.832 --> 00:04:27.626
If you don't pay for it,

00:04:27.776 --> 00:04:29.464
I will go straight to Pony's Home.

00:04:30.136 --> 00:04:31.663
To Pony's Home?

00:04:31.913 --> 00:04:34.500
Isn't there your family?

00:04:34.841 --> 00:04:38.770
Wait! I will pay!
Please give me some time.

00:04:38.990 --> 00:04:41.314
Ok... Bye.

00:04:42.515 --> 00:04:43.705
Make sure you don't forget!

00:04:45.385 --> 00:04:49.213
How am I going to pay
that amount of money?

00:04:49.363 --> 00:04:50.619
Candy!

00:04:50.957 --> 00:04:53.211
Quick, that patient...

00:04:54.293 --> 00:04:55.299
Charlie?

00:04:57.163 --> 00:04:58.460
What are you doing?

00:05:01.667 --> 00:05:03.760
Stop! No violence!

00:05:05.772 --> 00:05:07.933
Charlie! What are you doing?

00:05:08.408 --> 00:05:10.103
You messed up all this, Candy!

00:05:12.311 --> 00:05:15.506
You and that lousy doctor,
stop helping me.

00:05:15.656 --> 00:05:19.642
Helping someone like me
is going to get yourself in trouble.

00:05:21.521 --> 00:05:22.547
Doctor Bobson!

00:05:22.697 --> 00:05:24.615
Candy, get ready for treatment.

00:05:24.765 --> 00:05:25.717
Yes.

00:05:25.867 --> 00:05:28.124
It's none of your business!
Leave me alone!

00:05:28.428 --> 00:05:30.355
Increase the dose.

00:05:30.505 --> 00:05:32.090
We should get rid of people like this

00:05:32.240 --> 00:05:34.926
as soon as possible,
to stay away from trouble.

00:05:35.376 --> 00:05:37.466
I don't need you to reprimand me!

00:05:37.637 --> 00:05:39.605
That hurts, be careful!

00:05:49.081 --> 00:05:51.275
How do I raise so much money?

00:05:51.425 --> 00:05:54.547
I can't get another job.

00:06:02.128 --> 00:06:04.153
Charlie again?

00:06:13.405 --> 00:06:15.635
He is asleep.

00:06:18.444 --> 00:06:20.639
Then what was that sound...

00:06:40.633 --> 00:06:42.032
What happened?

00:06:44.436 --> 00:06:48.133
It's nothing, nurse.
I just need another glass...

00:06:48.940 --> 00:06:50.100
Let me help you.

00:06:50.250 --> 00:06:52.006
I'm sorry.

00:06:57.416 --> 00:07:00.817
I make more money
working in the hospital.

00:07:02.154 --> 00:07:04.515
Did auntie make all these flowers?

00:07:04.665 --> 00:07:05.783
Yeah.

00:07:05.933 --> 00:07:08.986
They are good for shop decoration
and stage play.

00:07:11.530 --> 00:07:12.961
Stage play?

00:07:25.410 --> 00:07:27.173
Mr. Terrius, I am a reporter.

00:07:27.913 --> 00:07:30.247
I'm not used taking interviews.

00:07:30.516 --> 00:07:32.009
Wait!

00:07:32.159 --> 00:07:36.041
Someone pretended to be you
because you are famous.

00:07:36.491 --> 00:07:37.647
Pretended to be me?

00:07:37.797 --> 00:07:40.650
Yeah, didn't you know?

00:07:40.800 --> 00:07:43.888
That man was hurt
and was sent to a hospital in Chicago.

00:07:45.363 --> 00:07:46.990
A hospital in Chicago...

00:07:47.666 --> 00:07:50.829
It might be the one
Candy is working in?

00:07:51.536 --> 00:07:52.863
What happened?

00:07:53.013 --> 00:07:55.031
Excuse me... I am sorry.

00:07:55.181 --> 00:07:56.771
Can you please give me more details?

00:07:57.576 --> 00:08:00.771
I should be the one
asking you for details.

00:08:00.921 --> 00:08:02.541
What happened?

00:08:04.850 --> 00:08:08.612
Shoot! I have to rush
for the morning edition.

00:08:08.862 --> 00:08:11.854
Please, tell me what happened.

00:08:19.331 --> 00:08:20.590
This flower...

00:08:20.740 --> 00:08:23.998
It might appear on Terry's stage.

00:08:30.175 --> 00:08:31.501
I got it wrong again.

00:08:31.651 --> 00:08:34.204
Auntie does it better.

00:08:36.748 --> 00:08:38.308
You are awake, Charlie!

00:08:38.458 --> 00:08:41.250
The nurses in this hospital
can have part time jobs?

00:08:42.220 --> 00:08:44.950
It is so boring to face you
every day like this!

00:08:45.857 --> 00:08:48.318
Why do you need money?

00:08:48.468 --> 00:08:51.221
Money? No...

00:08:51.371 --> 00:08:55.164
Do I have something to do with it?

00:08:55.600 --> 00:08:59.963
Have you heard of any nurses
who pay for their patients?

00:09:00.313 --> 00:09:03.171
Don't do it in front of me, Candy!

00:09:03.308 --> 00:09:06.903
Who knows you wouldn't go wild
if no one is watching you?

00:09:07.193 --> 00:09:08.575
I told you not to do it!

00:09:16.888 --> 00:09:20.178
You promise me
you will stay in bed?

00:09:20.328 --> 00:09:21.685
Right.

00:09:22.627 --> 00:09:24.220
Can I trust you on this?

00:09:24.370 --> 00:09:28.197
I said I won't betray anyone.

00:09:29.467 --> 00:09:31.492
I will do it in my room.

00:09:35.840 --> 00:09:37.337
Good night.

00:10:00.198 --> 00:10:02.758
Quiet! This is a hospital!

00:10:02.908 --> 00:10:05.529
Old man, are you from this hospital?

00:10:06.604 --> 00:10:08.030
Yes.

00:10:08.180 --> 00:10:11.438
I am looking for a nurse.
Her name is Candy.

00:10:24.154 --> 00:10:26.081
My sister told me
if I need any money...

00:10:26.231 --> 00:10:27.917
I can look for Candy.

00:10:28.067 --> 00:10:29.516
Eliza?

00:10:30.294 --> 00:10:31.825
You owe her a lot of money.

00:10:32.830 --> 00:10:34.891
Give me some more time.

00:10:35.041 --> 00:10:38.392
I will go for a ride now.

00:10:40.070 --> 00:10:42.402
To Pony's Home.

00:10:44.542 --> 00:10:45.901
Wait, Neil!

00:10:46.051 --> 00:10:48.420
No more delays.

00:10:48.570 --> 00:10:50.206
Give me another month.

00:10:50.456 --> 00:10:53.242
Do you know how many days
are there in a month?

00:10:53.392 --> 00:10:54.510
One week, at least!

00:10:54.660 --> 00:10:56.177
I don't have time.

00:10:56.921 --> 00:11:00.550
I need some money,
Grand Aunt Elroy doesn't know about it

00:11:00.925 --> 00:11:02.216
I will come back in two days.

00:11:02.366 --> 00:11:03.884
Two days?

00:11:04.461 --> 00:11:06.452
That's right. Two days.

00:11:08.933 --> 00:11:10.195
Neil!

00:11:11.569 --> 00:11:12.934
I will be waiting!

00:11:30.588 --> 00:11:32.920
Charlie, it's time
to take your temperature.

00:11:33.857 --> 00:11:35.417
You haven't had
your temperature taken today!

00:11:35.567 --> 00:11:37.551
Who is that guy?

00:11:39.229 --> 00:11:41.197
The one who drove here
to look for you.

00:11:42.066 --> 00:11:44.664
Neil, Eliza's brother.

00:11:45.336 --> 00:11:47.429
Now I get it!

00:11:47.579 --> 00:11:48.697
Charlie!

00:11:48.847 --> 00:11:52.936
Neil asked you for money.

00:11:53.444 --> 00:11:55.371
It has nothing to do with money.

00:11:55.521 --> 00:11:57.673
If Neil and Eliza are family,

00:11:57.823 --> 00:11:59.829
then, Candy, that money...

00:12:00.009 --> 00:12:02.311
It's not for hospital!

00:12:05.189 --> 00:12:07.657
You just said it yourself.

00:12:08.926 --> 00:12:10.325
What does she thinks she's doing?

00:12:10.527 --> 00:12:13.519
She put me in special ward!

00:12:15.099 --> 00:12:17.363
Charlie, no!

00:12:19.203 --> 00:12:21.364
Damn!

00:12:36.053 --> 00:12:37.512
No matter how good I am,

00:12:37.662 --> 00:12:39.953
I still can't make that much money.

00:12:56.640 --> 00:12:58.835
Charlie! Where are you going?

00:12:59.710 --> 00:13:02.110
Move! Don't disturb me!

00:13:02.546 --> 00:13:03.677
Charlie!

00:13:05.716 --> 00:13:08.180
Where are you going with that scalpel?

00:13:08.352 --> 00:13:10.415
Get lost, Candy!

00:13:10.821 --> 00:13:12.915
My God! Are you going to kill Eliza?

00:13:13.065 --> 00:13:16.255
I will teach them both a lesson.

00:13:16.626 --> 00:13:18.921
Charlie, if you do this...

00:13:19.071 --> 00:13:23.859
I have recovered, but still have
to go back to prison.

00:13:24.009 --> 00:13:26.828
You promised me
you won't do bad things again!

00:13:26.978 --> 00:13:29.860
I can't forgive those two people.

00:13:30.010 --> 00:13:33.372
Don't do it!
Your sin will grow deeper!

00:13:34.945 --> 00:13:36.242
Move, Candy!

00:13:42.085 --> 00:13:43.712
Charlie, you fool!

00:13:48.859 --> 00:13:50.121
Candy!

00:13:50.494 --> 00:13:53.725
Go ahead, I won't stop you!

00:14:07.477 --> 00:14:11.140
I said I never hated anyone before.

00:14:11.648 --> 00:14:13.980
Actually, I did hate someone.

00:14:14.651 --> 00:14:16.209
My mother.

00:14:25.195 --> 00:14:29.325
My mother worked very hard
just to raise me.

00:14:31.368 --> 00:14:34.963
At day time she worked in the factory
and she worked part time at night.

00:14:36.439 --> 00:14:39.700
Then, I became a gangster.

00:14:45.382 --> 00:14:49.478
I had a fight with my mother
and I left the house.

00:15:02.665 --> 00:15:06.465
That is why you won't let me
do any handwork.

00:15:07.937 --> 00:15:10.132
You remind me of my mother.

00:15:10.940 --> 00:15:13.135
What about your mother now?

00:15:13.476 --> 00:15:15.444
She is still working.

00:15:16.045 --> 00:15:19.811
Yeah?
She must be doing better than me.

00:15:21.184 --> 00:15:22.811
How about your mother?

00:15:23.001 --> 00:15:25.721
When I was little,
my family abandoned me.

00:15:27.157 --> 00:15:28.350
Really?

00:15:28.500 --> 00:15:30.484
But I am not lonely.

00:15:32.695 --> 00:15:37.294
I have many people caring for me.

00:15:42.005 --> 00:15:45.031
So I am not lonely.

00:15:45.575 --> 00:15:47.968
I'm beginning to understand now.

00:15:48.178 --> 00:15:49.401
What?

00:15:49.551 --> 00:15:52.140
Why Terry likes you.

00:16:01.925 --> 00:16:04.853
That's all I got.

00:16:05.003 --> 00:16:06.987
Neil will come today for the money.

00:16:08.832 --> 00:16:10.527
Candy, you have a letter.

00:16:11.034 --> 00:16:12.262
Me?

00:16:13.937 --> 00:16:15.495
Looks like it's from a gentleman.

00:16:16.639 --> 00:16:18.436
Thank you, Franny.

00:16:19.742 --> 00:16:21.334
It's from Terry!

00:16:25.381 --> 00:16:26.408
Candy.

00:16:26.558 --> 00:16:31.648
I am on a show tour in the
Mississippi coast town of St. Louis.

00:16:42.599 --> 00:16:45.121
Reporters have told me about Charlie.

00:16:45.271 --> 00:16:47.429
Charlie is an important friend.

00:16:47.579 --> 00:16:50.098
He helped me a lot when I was young.

00:16:50.873 --> 00:16:52.467
No matter what he has done,

00:16:52.617 --> 00:16:54.533
I still trust he is a good lad.

00:16:55.211 --> 00:16:59.238
It is destiny that brought you two
to meet each other.

00:16:59.949 --> 00:17:03.241
Please look after him for me
with the cheque attached.

00:17:04.653 --> 00:17:06.580
Don't tell Charlie about the money.

00:17:06.730 --> 00:17:09.453
He would not accept them.

00:17:13.762 --> 00:17:15.923
So much money...

00:17:16.799 --> 00:17:18.526
I miss you so much.

00:17:18.676 --> 00:17:20.762
The show is busy here, I barely
have time to stop by to see you.

00:17:21.403 --> 00:17:24.930
I am really sorry
that I can't meet you on this.

00:17:25.975 --> 00:17:27.237
Terry...

00:17:29.512 --> 00:17:31.839
If there is any money left,

00:17:31.989 --> 00:17:34.883
buy some strawberry drinks
for Charlie.

00:17:35.417 --> 00:17:38.682
He likes only strawberry drink.

00:17:40.789 --> 00:17:42.780
Strawberry drink?

00:17:44.193 --> 00:17:46.720
The invoice is settled.

00:17:46.870 --> 00:17:50.788
Charlie will be happy
to see strawberry drink.

00:17:57.006 --> 00:17:59.006
Charlie, I got a present for you...

00:18:03.212 --> 00:18:04.419
Charlie...

00:18:12.121 --> 00:18:15.318
Natalie, have you seen Charlie?

00:18:15.724 --> 00:18:18.420
He has been moved
to the juvenile prison hospital.

00:18:22.664 --> 00:18:24.425
I allowed it.

00:18:24.575 --> 00:18:27.161
He has recovered.

00:18:27.311 --> 00:18:28.495
Doctor Bobson...

00:18:28.645 --> 00:18:30.998
Patients checking in or out

00:18:31.148 --> 00:18:36.375
will be my call,
I don't have to inform any nurse.

00:18:36.578 --> 00:18:37.604
Yes.

00:18:37.754 --> 00:18:39.943
Thank you for your care.

00:18:40.782 --> 00:18:42.215
Candy!

00:18:42.651 --> 00:18:46.013
Regardless of who they are,
as long as they come to the hospital,

00:18:46.163 --> 00:18:49.316
patients have the right
to receive good treatment.

00:18:49.466 --> 00:18:52.754
Charlie must be happy.

00:18:56.265 --> 00:18:59.757
He will be happy after
he gets out from the prison, I guess.

00:19:06.074 --> 00:19:08.135
Hurry up, Candy!

00:19:08.285 --> 00:19:10.610
The next patient is here.

00:19:21.757 --> 00:19:23.691
Charlie made them.

00:19:33.602 --> 00:19:35.796
Although Charlie didn't tell me,

00:19:35.946 --> 00:19:39.102
surely he helped his mother
with the handwork.

00:19:46.248 --> 00:19:49.709
He thanked me and Doctor Bobson.

00:19:49.859 --> 00:19:52.116
That is why
he left these two flowers.

00:19:58.894 --> 00:20:00.259
Charlie!

00:20:06.001 --> 00:20:08.401
Nice job!

00:20:08.937 --> 00:20:11.865
This is from Charlie's heart.

00:20:12.015 --> 00:20:14.668
I have healed his wounded face,

00:20:14.818 --> 00:20:18.543
but you have comforted his sad heart.

00:20:19.547 --> 00:20:22.242
Doctor,
do you like strawberry drink?

00:20:22.392 --> 00:20:24.585
It was my favourite when I was young.

00:20:32.928 --> 00:20:34.090
No!

00:20:35.563 --> 00:20:40.093
This is how we drink it.

00:20:43.672 --> 00:20:46.470
Right! Cheers!

00:20:55.083 --> 00:20:58.612
The warm wind breezes into the room
in the summer evening.

00:20:58.762 --> 00:21:03.021
Candy and Doctor Bobson
are enjoying the strawberry drinks.

00:21:03.858 --> 00:21:05.452
The cold and fizzy drinks,

00:21:05.602 --> 00:21:08.154
sparkling like
Charlie's revitalised heart,

00:21:08.304 --> 00:21:10.857
are fresh and cool.
